'''2B0T''', referred to as '''Two-Boots''', was a [[Unidentified police droid model (Janix)|police droid]] who was active as part of the<ref name="Databank" /> [[Tactical Defense Force]]<ref name="SOM1" /> on the [[planet]] [[Janix]] during the [[Imperial Era]].<ref name="Databank" /> During or after [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{ShadowofMaulDate|1}}</ref> Two-Boots and his partner, [[Captain]] [[Brander Lawson]],<ref name="Databank" /> were attempting to investigate lawless dealings occurring on the planet that were connected to the [[Force-Sensitive Outcast|former]] [[Sith]] and [[crime lord]] [[Maul]].<ref name="Reveal" />

